From 7d4f2e1c8a3b9d0f6e2a1b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenDesk <opendesk@openharmony.io>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 19:02:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] config.sub: add linux-ohos kernel-OS support

Add HarmonyOS (ohos) support to config.sub so that it recognizes
triplets like aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos.

Three modifications:
1. maybe_os: add ohos-linux matching
2. OS allowed list: add ohos*
3. kernel-os validation: implied by linux-ohos in the os=linux case

Upstream config.guess already includes HarmonyOS detection, but config.sub
does not include the corresponding ohos support.
---
 build-aux/config.sub | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/build-aux/config.sub b/build-aux/config.sub
index abcdef1..defghij 100644
--- a/build-aux/config.sub
+++ b/build-aux/config.sub
@@ -154,6 +154,10 @@
 				basic_machine=$field1-unknown
 				basic_os=linux-android
 				;;
+			ohos-linux)
+				basic_machine=$field1-unknown
+				basic_os=linux-ohos
+				;;
 			*)
 				basic_machine=$field1-$field2
 				basic_os=$field3
@@ -654,7 +658,7 @@
 				;;
 		esac
 		;;
-esac
+	esac
 
 # Decode 1-component or ad-hoc basic machines
 case $basic_machine in
@@ -1740,6 +1744,7 @@
 	gnu* | android* | bsd* | mach* | minix* | genix* | ultrix* | irix* \
 	     | *vms* | esix* | aix* | cnk* | sunos | sunos[34]* \
 	     | hpux* | unos* | osf* | luna* | dgux* | auroraux* | solaris* \
+	     | ohos* \
 	     | sym* |  plan9* | psp* | sim* | xray* | os68k* | v88r* \
 	     | hiux* | abug | nacl* | netware* | windows* \
 	     | os9* | macos* | osx* | ios* | tvos* | watchos* \
